  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to Support the Technological and Digital Transformation of MSMEs in El Salvador</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de apoyo a la transformacin tecnolgica y digital de MIPYME en El Salvador</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo es apoyar el aumento de la adopcin de transformacin tecnolgica y digital de las MIPYME en El Salvador. El objetivo especfico de desarrollo espromover inversiones en transformacin tecnolgica y digital, a travs de financiamiento a MIPYME.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general development objective is to support the increase in the adoption of technological and digital transformation of MSMEs in El Salvador. The specific development objective is to promote investments in technological and digital transformation through financing for MSMEs.</narrative>
  </description>
